<p>
  The board is a <code>Y.Array</code> named <code>cards</code>. Each card is a
  <code>Y.Map</code> with an id, its text, and its column. Adding a card adds a
  map to the array, and deleting one removes it. Moving a card only changes its
  <code>column</code>, so two people can drag different cards at once without
  conflicts. If you both move the same card, the last move wins. Drag a card by
  the handle on its left edge.
</p>
